# Full-quality Pantheon Ep.1 renders exceed GitHub's 100MB push limit
# (final: 574MB, segments: 163-263MB each). Delivered to the user
# directly instead - see production/pantheon-ep1-status.md.
output/pantheon-ep1-final.mp4
output/pantheon-ep1-segment-*.mp4

# Pantheon Ep.2 local-assembly intermediates (50 normalized per-shot
# clips, concat list, full-res 386MB final, uncompressed video-only pass)
# - not final deliverables, not meant to be committed. Preview is
# delivered via chat, not committed. The full-quality compressed
# version (output/pantheon-ep2-full-compressed.mp4, under 100MB) IS
# meant to be committed, same pattern as Ep.1.
# See production/pantheon-ep2-status.md.
output/ep2-segments/
output/pantheon-ep2-final.mp4
output/pantheon-ep2-video-only.mp4
output/pantheon-ep2-preview.mp4
output/ffmpeg2pass-*
